  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_device_label">
    <text>Device name</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_device_label_desc">
    <text>Text before the serial number on the second line.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_distortion">
    <text>Fisheye distortion</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_in_image">
    <text>Draw lens edge in the image</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_in_image_desc">
    <text>On (default): lens edge, vignette and grain are part of the image, under the game HUD and safe with frame generation. Off: drawn as a HUD layer on top of everything.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_radius">
    <text>Lens edge size</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_shape">
    <text>Lens edge shape</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_shape_desc">
    <text>0 = round, 1 = follows the screen shape.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_softness">
    <text>Lens edge softness</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_enabled">
    <text>Enable Zone Bodycam</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_font_size">
    <text>Overlay text size</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_grain">
    <text>Sensor grain</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_impacts">
    <text>Impacts (steps, landings, shots, hits)</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_intensity">
    <text>Lens strength</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_iso_t">
    <text>ISO "T" before the time</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_lens_enabled">
    <text>Bodycam lens</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_lens_enabled_desc">
    <text>Fisheye lens, housing, sharpening and grain. Applied after DLSS/FSR, so the upscaler never sees it.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_logo_opacity">
    <text>Logo opacity</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_logo_style">
    <text>Logo</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_motion">
    <text>Body motion (all)</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_overlay">
    <text>Bodycam overlay (top right)</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_rec_timer">
    <text>Recording timer (top left)</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_rec_timer_desc">
    <text>Flashing red dot and how long the camera has been recording in this playthrough. Real time, saved with the game.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_roll">
    <text>Camera roll</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_sharpen">
    <text>Sensor sharpening</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_show_name">
    <text>Show character name</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_text_opacity">
    <text>Text opacity</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_timezone">
    <text>Time zone</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_title">
    <text>Zone Bodycam</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_turn_invert">
    <text>Invert turn lag</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_turn_lag">
    <text>Turn lag</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_vignette">
    <text>Vignette</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_walk_bob">
    <text>Walking bob</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_zoom">
    <text>Lens zoom</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_zoom_desc">
    <text>Minimum crop. The lens always zooms in far enough to fill the screen for the current fisheye distortion and screen shape, so there are no black edges. Set this higher to crop in further.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies">
    <text>Ally markers</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_color_companion">
    <text>Colour: companions</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_enemies">
    <text>Mark enemies</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_enemies_desc">
    <text>Enemies get a box too, decoding from white to the enemy colour. Off: only friendly stalkers are marked.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_color_friend">
    <text>Colour: friendly</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_color_enemy">
    <text>Colour: enemy</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_desc">
    <text>A box on every stalker the camera sees. It starts white while the stalker is unknown, then decodes to green (friendly) or red (enemy) as the name resolves.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_dot_ratio">
    <text>Show as dot beyond (share of range)</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_los">
    <text>Only NPCs you can see</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_opacity">
    <text>Marker opacity</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_range">
    <text>Marker range (metres)</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_size">
    <text>Marker size</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_names">
    <text>Show names</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_names_desc">
    <text>The stalker's name above each box, in the overlay font. Hidden while the marker is a dot.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_allies_style">
    <text>Marker style</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_follow">
    <text>Lens edge follows movement</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_follow_desc">
    <text>How much the lens edge and vignette move with the body motion, like a camera strapped to the chest. 0 = fixed.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_rig_occlusion">
    <text>Chest rig / shoulder occlusion</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_rig_occlusion_desc">
    <text>How strongly your plate carrier, shoulders, and rifle encroach into the edges of the frame when leaning, crouching, aiming, or looking down.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_housing_roundness">
    <text>Housing shape (circle to squircle)</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_housing_roundness_desc">
    <text>0 = smooth oval lens bezel, 1 = rounded-square Axon housing frame.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_soft_blur">
    <text>Peripheral lens softness</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_edge_soft_blur_desc">
    <text>Wide-angle optical softening toward the edges of the frame while keeping the center sharp.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_highlight_blowout">
    <text>Highlight blowout</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_highlight_blowout_desc">
    <text>Small-sensor dynamic range clipping and bright-light roll-off on sky, lamps, and muzzle flashes.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_compression">
    <text>Digital compression crispness</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_compression_desc">
    <text>Subtle bodycam video encoder micro-block crispness and chroma subsampling feel.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_rolling_shutter">
    <text>Rolling shutter shear</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_rolling_shutter_desc">
    <text>CMOS scanline skew during fast turns, gunfire, and hits. 0 = off.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_face_blur">
    <text>Blur faces</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_face_blur_desc">
    <text>Pixelates the faces of the stalkers the camera sees, like released bodycam footage. Works with the lens on or off.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_sensor_grade">
    <text>CMOS color grade</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_sensor_grade_desc">
    <text>Modern Axon CMOS contrast curve, slight desaturation, and cool-neutral digital tone.</text>
  </string>
